<title>USA: Chancellor Corp names new president/CEO.</title>
<headline>Chancellor Corp names new president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON, Mass. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chancellor Corp said Monday that it has named John Powell as its new president and chief executive.</p>
<p>Powell succeeds Stephen Morison, who resigned as chief executive and president on December 3, said spokeswoman Betsy Nisbet. Nisbet did not say why Morison resigned.</p>
<p>Before joining Chancellor Powell was president and founder of a California financial services company specializing in leveraged lease equipment financing and remarketing, the company said.</p>
